---
layout: layout.vto
title: Games
---
<h1>favorite games</h1>
<p> a collection of my favorite games<br>
some i grew up with, some i discovered pretty recently<br>
should give you an insight on the kind of person i am.
</p>

<div class="games">
  {{ for game of games }}
  <div class="game">
    <a class="banner" href="{{ game.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      <img src="{{ game.img }}" alt="{{ game.name }}">
    </a>
    <div class="game-info">
      <strong>{{ game.name }}</strong>
      <p>{{ game.desc }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  {{ /for }}
</div>
